s-found-in-the-mock-api-and-fixed-p2", "README#chaos-testing-losing-an-inference-pod-under-load", "K8S_RUNBOOK#crashloopbackoff"], "cited": ["K8S_RUNBOOK#oomkilled"], "expected": ["K8S_RUNBOOK#oomkilled"], "answer": "In `k8s/api.yaml`, the API container has a memory request of 128Mi and a memory limit of 256Mi. Its CPU is set to 100m requested with a 1-core limit. If the API grew past 256Mi, it would show up as OOMKilled restarts in the Kubernetes CI job."}}
