_RUNBOOK#after-the-fix", "README#chaos-testing-losing-an-inference-pod-under-load", "K8S_RUNBOOK#oomkilled"], "cited": ["K8S_RUNBOOK#crashloopbackoff"], "expected": ["K8S_RUNBOOK#crashloopbackoff"], "answer": "The kubelet waits longer after each crash before restarting the container: 10 s, then 20 s, then 40 s and so on, capped at 5 minutes. This growing waiting period is what the `CrashLoopBackOff` status shows. It is a symptom, not a cause: the cause is whatever makes the container exit."}}
