", "README#ci-cd-github-actions-p2", "README#ci-cd-github-actions", "README#project-layout", "README#run-against-a-qa-server"], "cited": ["README#aws-qa-environment"], "expected": ["README#aws-qa-environment"], "answer": "There is a built-in safety net: the instance terminates itself after 60 minutes even if CI never deletes it. It does this by running `shutdown` with `InstanceInitiatedShutdownBehavior: terminate`. Normally CI deletes the environment on every run, including when tests fail or the run is cancelled. It then fails if any instance tagged `project=qa-env` is left."}}
